      "text": "StreamFilesConnector\n\nSource: FileSource (TextLineInputFormat)\n/tmp/sample_data/input.txt\n\nTransform: map(parseInt + 1)\n\nSink: FileSink\n/tmp/sample_data/output\n+ print\n\nAsync: env.executeAsync()\n+ pollJobStatusUntilTerminal()",
